  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d01fd2d64a9249049aaa77d5c12a82fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: Question 12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: 'The expression for the figure of merit of the galvanometer is given
    by:'
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: 'The figure of merit k is defined as the current required for
    deflecting the pointer by one division. It is denoted by k.


    k = I<sub>g</sub>
    / N


    Where I<sub>g</sub> is the current required for full scale deflection.
    N is the total number of division of the galvanometer.'
  options:
  - I<sub>g</sub> = N/K
  - k =I<sub>g</sub> / N
  - I<sub>g</sub> = N
  - None of the above
  correctOptionIndex: 1
